# React Component Patterns

## 🎯 Component Architecture

### Feature-First Organization
Components are organized by features in [apps/web/src/features/](mdc:apps/web/src/features/):
- **`map/`** - Map visualization and interaction components
- **`route-planner/`** - Route planning and calculation components  
- **`vessel/`** - Vessel profile and configuration components

### Component Hierarchy
```
App.tsx (Root component)
├── MapSimplified (Map interface)
│   ├── MapLibre GL Integration
│   ├── Waypoint Management
│   └── Route Visualization
├── RoutePlanner (Route planning)
│   ├── Waypoint Input
│   ├── Route Controls
│   └── Results Display
├── VesselProfile (Vessel management)
│   ├── Vessel Selection
│   ├── Safety Settings
│   └── AIS Integration
└── Shared UI Components
    ├── SlidePanel
    ├── ActionDock
    └── StatusLedger
```

